## 💻 Code
See [`health_monitoring.ino`](./health_monitoring.ino) for the full Arduino source code.

```cpp
void loop() {
  bpm = readPulse();                    // read heart rate from A0
  temperature = readTemperature();      // read LM35 from A1

  lcd.clear();
  lcd.print("BPM:"); lcd.print(bpm);
  lcd.setCursor(0,1);
  lcd.print("Temp:"); lcd.print(temperature);

  if (bpm > 100 || bpm < 50 || temperature > 38.0)
      digitalWrite(buzzerPin, HIGH);     // alert
  else
      digitalWrite(buzzerPin, LOW);

  sendToThingSpeak(bpm, temperature);    // upload via ESP8266
  delay(15000);
}
```

